    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its cramped and inadequate internal space, lack of private external amenity space, and substandard communal amenity space, would fail to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation for future occupiers, contrary to Local Plan policies SC5 and SC6 and London Plan policy D6.  ",
